andLine contains " -EncodedCommand " OR CommandLine contains " -w hidden " OR CommandLine contains " -windowstyle hidden" OR CommandLine contains ".WebClient).Download")) OR (OriginalFileName equals "wmic.exe" AND CommandLine contains " /node:")))
